  "chapter": {
    "number": 113,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(114) Alleluia."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "At the going forth of Israel from Egypt, of the house of Jacob from a barbarous people,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Judea became his",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 211
          },
          {
            "text": "sanctuary, and Israel his dominion.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The sea saw and fled: Jordan was turned back.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The mountains skipped like rams, and the hills like lambs.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "What ailed you, O sea, that you fled? and you Jordan, that you were turned back?",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "You⌃ mountains, that you⌃ skipped like rams, and you⌃ hills, like lambs?",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "The earth trembled at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the God of Jacob;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "who turned the rock into pools of water, and the",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "noteId": 212
          },
          {
            "text": "flint into fountains of water.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 211,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Or, consecrated thing.",
        "reference": {
          "chapter": 113,
          "verse": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "noteId": 212,
        "caller": "+",
        "text": "Gr. sharp rock.",
